### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3003/clientes


### Buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:3003/clientes/1


### Criar cliente
POST http://localhost:3003/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Gabriel",
    "sobrenome": "Lucim",
    "telefone": "44999999999",
    "email": "gabriel@email.com"
}